flowchart LR
  K[Hermes Kanban<br/>execution authority] -->|versioned snapshot| A[Truth adapter]
  G[Git revisions + evidence<br/>acceptance authority] --> A
  A --> C[Framework-independent coordinator]
  C --> W[World stack]
  C --> AG[Agents stack]
  C --> B[Build stack]
  C --> R[Review stack]
  W & AG & B & R --> V[React view adapter]
  V --> X[One Canvas / rAF owner]
  V --> U[Safe-area shell + one inspector]
  U -->|explicit intent + durable ID| A
  A -. prototype .-> F[Synthetic fixture journal]
  A -. separate approval .-> K
